[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_01_0010","text":"制作人……\n一直以来……谢谢你……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_01_0020","text":"……嗯？\n怎么了？突然这么客气。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_01_0030","text":"因为你总是……\n开车送我……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_01_0040","text":"哈哈，原来是这事。\n没事的，一点都不觉得辛苦。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_01_0050","text":"会吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_01_0060","text":"开车也有开车的乐趣在……\n等雾子以后会开车了就知道了。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_01_0062","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_01_0070","text":"等我……学会开车了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_01_0080","text":"制作人……累的时候……\n我来……开车送你……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_01_0090","text":"哦，可以吗？\n那我可期待着了。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_01_0100","text":"呵呵……"}]
